    "intro": {
      "zh": "Sony PlayStation 4 是索尼 2013 年发布的第八代家用游戏机，回归 x86 架构、大幅降低开发门槛，凭借易开发路线与丰富独占成为第八代主机销量冠军、累计销量破亿，是游戏机厅第八代主机「x86 易开发」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Sony PlayStation 4, released in 2013, returned to an x86 architecture that greatly lowered development barriers, and became the eighth-generation sales champion with over 100 million units sold."
    },
    "era": 2013, "manufacturer": "Sony"
  },
